<title>GABON: SOCCER-GABON AND CAMEROON DRAW 0-0 IN AFRICA CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GABON AND CAMEROON DRAW 0-0 IN AFRICA CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabon and Cameroon drew 0-0 in</p>
<p>an African Nations Cup soccer championship qualifier on Sunday.</p>
</text>
